      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sequenceDiagram": true
      },
      "text": "• PostgreSQL is the source of truth; WebSocket events are ephemeral delivery only.  • pg-boss handles durable delivery/retry/recovery.\n• Guarded state transitions protect concurrency.  • Processing continues when clients disconnect.  • GitHub Actions: install → typecheck → lint → tests → Prisma checks → build → deploy/smoke test.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• PostgreSQL is the source of truth; WebSocket events are ephemeral delivery only.  • pg-boss handles durable delivery/retry/recovery.\n• Guarded state transitions protect concurrency.  • Processing continues when clients disconnect.  • GitHub Actions: install → typecheck → lint → tests → Prisma checks → build → deploy/smoke test.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
